# p_4f8e — The burst worker: two desk blocks, coffee table in between (fork of p_a1b2)

Fork of p_a1b2. The parent's core claim that laptop_omar sits at desk_o1 continuously from 09:00 to 17:30 has been hammered: 12 empty looks at desk_o1 during work hours versus only 4 hits. The clock-hour sightings make the real pattern clear — the laptop is at desk_o1 at 09:00, 10:00, 13:00, 15:00 and at coffee_table_l1 at 03:00 and 18:00. Omar works in two bursts (09–11 and 13–15) and the laptop goes to the coffee table during the lunch gap (11–13) and the evening wind-down (15–17.5). The mouse and headphones follow the laptop; the pen is only at the desk during active typing.

I also corrected the overnight resting positions that the mixture got wrong at the 03:00 patrol: both water bottles are in the dish_rack_k1 (washed and drying), the guitar is in the wardrobe_b1 (not on the bedroom floor), and Marco's charger is on the bedroom_floor_b1 (not at desk_b1). The headphones rest at desk_o1 overnight, which the parent got right.

The pencil_case_omar, sketchbook_omar, and plant_pot_3_shared are NOT at desk_o1 during work hours (16 empty looks each). They are stored on the office_shelf_o1 or at desk_b1, not on Omar's work surface.

